<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Carso 1996 net. [CORRECTED 02:00 GMT 13/2]</title>
<headline>Mexico's Carso 1996 net. [CORRECTED 02:00 GMT 13/2]</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p>	Shr		 3.61		     3.15</p>
<p>	Net		 3.303 bln		2.884 bln</p>
<p>	Revs		23.979 bln	    22.819 bln</p>
<p>	Gross profit    8.324 bln		7.853 bln</p>
<p>	Oper income     5.137 bln		4.716 bln</p>
<p>	Int fin cost    203 mln	   cost 2.723 bln</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Carso SA.</p>
<p>(Grupo Carso SA corrects its 1996 results released through the Mexican Stock Exchange. The figures were wrong in terms of operating income, integrated financial cost and operating costs).</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9565))  </p>
<p>MEXICO CITY, Feb 12 (Reuter) -</p>
